## 17. Risks & Mitigations

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| Larger hydration payload | Limit messages (30) & exclude heavy fields |
| Stale persona/settings after change | Manual invalidate hydration key on edit |
| Realtime gaps / missed events | Fallback periodic (5–10 min) lightweight sync |
| Edge function timeout if adding more | Keep parallel Promise.all; avoid heavy summarization inside hydration |

